        card(2, "The Man-in-the-Middle (MITM) Threat", "An imposter intercepting letters at the post office, creating separate secret codes with Alice and Bob.", "Unauthenticated Diffie-Hellman is vulnerable to MITM: Mallory intercepts Alice's A and sends her M1; intercepts Bob's B and sends him M2. She decrypts and re-encrypts all traffic.", "Solution: Authenticate public keys using digital signatures and X.509 certificates."),
